    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000tl1s](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000tl1s) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 72.495 depth occurred on Aug 15 2026 26km S of Tinombo. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 0.1542 longitude 120.2573. It impacted 123016 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
